    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9c3ce0f03e74ee6b059e66</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 16:40:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一期承诺大家已久的节目，一个我和B哥吐槽多年的导演，没说的，火力全开吐槽这部诺兰导演的新片[奥德赛]！</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期节目非常有倾向性甚至于是偏见（B哥是天下第一诺黑，我是天下第二诺黑），诺兰粉丝慎入！</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:00:25</a> [奥德赛]电影信息介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">00:15:00</a> B哥和非凡哥眼中电影为数不多的优点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">00:28:53</a> 按顺序挨段吐槽剧情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5673">01:34:33</a> 吐槽选角和演员表演</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6160">01:42:40</a> 这部电影的精神内核真的很恶心人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7072">01:57:52</a> 吐槽诺导，攒局很厉害，拍摄很粗糙，缺乏个人表达</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8361">02:19:21</a> 吐槽电影票价</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8468">02:21:08</a> 期待诺导的下一部作品，继续吐槽</span></p><p></p><p><span>BGM</span></p><p><span>开头 Ludwig Göransson - Ithaca</span></p><p><span>结尾 Ludwig Göransson - Odysseus</span></p><p><span>欢迎听友们关注，评论，转发！</span></p>]]></description>
