    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>互相推荐系列之六</span></p><p><span>B哥给非凡哥推荐姜文电影</span></p><p><span>[太阳照常升起]。</span></p><p><span>2018年 上海电影节 大光明电影院 1300人大厅</span></p><p><span>[太阳照常升起] </span></p><p><span>35毫米胶片版放映</span></p><p><span>姜文作为当届上影节主席 到场 云：</span></p><p><span>[我现在都不敢相信，我当年拍出了这么牛逼的作品。]</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 作为œuvre的姜文电影总览</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 疯 恋 枪 梦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 疯妈的脚和姜文的妈</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 疯妈喻时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a> 老梁摸屁股</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 老梁被林医生狠狠撩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 老唐被小队长戴绿帽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3116">51:56</a> 唐妻阅尽人间春色</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3472">57:52</a> 阿廖沙和老唐是同一个人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3885">1:04:45</a> 小队长 小白屋 异托邦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4230">1:10:30</a> 他一笑天就亮了：叙事能量，创造自由</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4450">1:14:10</a> 他一笑天就亮了：日月光华，旦复旦兮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4770">1:19:30</a> 隐喻的整体性理解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5154">1:25:54</a> 隐喻的政治性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5343">1:29:03</a> 魔幻现实的现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5922">1:38:42</a> 从莫扎特到久石让</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6244">1:44:04</a> 从姜文到Jonah Hill</span></p><p><span>开头 Joe Hisaishi - The Sun Also Rises</span></p><p><span>结尾 Joe Hisaishi - Singanushiga</span></p><p><span>欢迎听友们关注，评论，转发！</span></p>]]></description>
