    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>互相推荐系列之五，B哥给非凡哥推荐2023年戛纳电影节金棕榈得主，法国电影[坠落的审判]。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这部电影证明了，当代法国电影，不全是行活儿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> 这是第一部B哥给非凡哥推荐的，没让他看睡着的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> B哥推荐理由</span></p><span></span><p><span>拉比注释式拉片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 第一幕 死亡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 第二幕 家庭事件变成法院案件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">21:43</a> 第三幕 庭审交锋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a> 第四幕 庭审的华彩篇章 解读一段激烈争吵的录音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3102">51:42</a> 第五幕 儿子作证 全篇官子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3636">1:00:36</a> 儿子作证的谜团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4426">1:13:46</a> 影音对真的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4470">1:14:30</a> 女导演的分寸感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4978">1:22:58</a> 狗究竟象征什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5353">1:29:13</a> 总结推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头 Bacao Rhythm &amp; Steel Band - PIMP</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾 Benoît Daniel - Variation Autour d'un prélude</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎听友们订阅，评论！</span></p>]]></description>
