    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是“B哥非凡哥相互推荐”系列的第二炮！</span></p><span></span><p><span>B哥给非凡哥推荐了一部自己的心头好：日本动画电影[人狼]。</span></p><span></span><p><span>B哥甚至入手了这部电影的日文版蓝光碟。如此让B哥爱不释手的电影会给非凡哥留下何种印象？两个人的讨论又会如何抽丝剥茧，把错综复杂的剧情咂摸出味道？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 近期观影体验交流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> [人狼]极简版剧情梳理</span></p><span></span><p><span>围绕剧情的问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a> 不同高层派别究竟是何关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 男主的旧友背叛男主的动机？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 特机队的终极任务是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 人狼是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a> [人狼]到底想表达什么？和[小红帽]有什么关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> [人狼]和[色戒]的勾连和差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> [人狼]的影射了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> B哥推荐[人狼]的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span>非凡哥的吐槽和B哥的回应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 无效留白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3319">55:19</a> 人物苍白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3676">01:01:16</a> 概念先行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3973">01:06:13</a> 非凡哥现阶段的电影口味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4360">01:12:40</a> [大开眼戒]call back</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头和结尾的BGM：Grace - from "Jin-Roh" Original Soundtrack</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家点击关注，留言评论，期待与你们的交流。</span></p>]]></description>
