    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是“B哥非凡互推荐”系列的第一炮！B哥推荐给我他看过我没看过的电影，我推荐给B哥我看过他没看过的电影，看看能给对方惊吓还是惊喜~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="36">00:36</a> 整活儿 The power of Christ compels you!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 扯闲篇儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> [驱魔人]电影介绍 艺术成就+票房成就</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> 给B哥推荐这部电影的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> B哥回忆自己寥寥无几的恐怖片观影经历&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> B哥专门去电影院看这部[驱魔人]</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> [驱魔人]是一部慢节奏、重铺垫的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> B哥谈在电影院看[驱魔人]的体感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2448">40:48</a> 恐怖片和喜剧片仅有一墙之隔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3088">51:28</a> B哥谈对魔鬼上身的认识</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3249">54:09</a> 萨勒姆女巫事件&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3397">56:37</a> 跳脱出电影的故事，其实会发现恐怖片别样的乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头BGM Mike Oldfield - Tubular Bells</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM Vyan,SuperDeep - 驱魔人</span></p>]]></description>
